            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Sandstorm"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, divine, earth)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe aghash creates a temporary sandstorm in a 30 foot emanation that lasts for 1 minute. Creatures within the emanation take a \u20134 circumstance penalty to Perception checks and must succeed at a 18 Fortitude save. On a failure, they're forced to hold their breath or else they start suffocating. A creature within the sandstorm at the end of its turn takes 1d6 slashing damage. Divs are immune to all effects of an aghash's sandstorm."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "three_actions"
            },
